Use the utility to print node tables from IEEE 802.11 interfaces.
Use  the  flag to print the nodes for all interfaces, or list one
or more 802.11 interfaces to select their tables for examination.
The flag causes only nodes that do not have encryption enabled to
be printed.  For example, to examine the node  tables  for  atw0,
use:  wlanctl  atw0 may print this node table, for example: atw0:
